# UI-PAUSE-1: the pause box is modal; "Continue game" resumes. From the default start view: P
# pauses, then three presses inside the box. Beside the button and on the part of the box that
# covers the construction tab, nothing changes (that tab would otherwise open the construction
# menu). On the button (hud.txt pause_button, 286 500 244 x 67) the game resumes. Runs on the GPU
# window: a paused CPU window draws no frames.
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
expect fact game.paused == 0
note fact ui.tab
key p
expect fact game.paused == 1
click_px 600 533
expect fact game.paused == 1
click_px 790 200
expect fact game.paused == 1
expect fact ui.tab same
click_px 408 533
expect fact game.paused == 0
expect fact ui.tab same
quit
